      "cooked": "<p>What does consider process loss checkbox in workorder exactly do<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/7/e7e1f471e0995bd51ae47ea3044ced09957c5c25.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/e7e1f471e0995bd51ae47ea3044ced09957c5c25\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/7/e7e1f471e0995bd51ae47ea3044ced09957c5c25_2_690x236.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"x5koUgwaaMyw7AsMkDYnm47CAZf\" width=\"690\" height=\"236\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/7/e7e1f471e0995bd51ae47ea3044ced09957c5c25_2_690x236.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/7/e7e1f471e0995bd51ae47ea3044ced09957c5c25_2_1035x354.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/7/e7e1f471e0995bd51ae47ea3044ced09957c5c25_2_1380x472.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"A3A3A2\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1387×476 36.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
